<title>SOUTH AFRICA: OMNIA IN ADVANCED TALKS ON SEED UNIT SALE.</title>
<headline>OMNIA IN ADVANCED TALKS ON SEED UNIT SALE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omnia Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday that negotiations on the sale of its seed business had reached an advanced stage and it urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
